[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":112},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-mo-ibrahim-foundation-soas-scholarship-2026-at-university-of-london-for-africans-fully-funded-293":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},293,"mo-ibrahim-foundation-soas-scholarship-2026-at-university-of-london-for-africans-fully-funded-293","Mo Ibrahim Foundation Soas Scholarship 2026 At University Of London For Africans: Fully Funded","\u003Cp>The Mo Ibrahim Foundation SOAS Scholarship includes a £45,479 grant awarded to help selected candidates cover the costs of tuition and living stipends.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Mo Ibrahim Foundation SOAS Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: Mo Ibrahim Foundation x SOAS University of London\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-uk\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study-In-UK\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: United Kingdom\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> ||  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>$45,479 Living Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Africa Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: June 17, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Mo Ibrahim Foundation Scholarship 2026 Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Mo Ibrahim Foundation, an African organisation founded and funded by Dr Mo Ibrahim and dedicated to strengthening leadership and governance across the continent, has generously established a new scholarship at SOAS. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>This award aims to support and nurture future leaders committed to Africa’s development.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>In line with the Foundation’s core values, preference will be given to applicants who are ordinarily resident in Africa and to those who demonstrate a clear interest in governance and\u002For development in Africa.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>There are two awards available for 2026\u002F27, each with a total value of £45,479. Tuition fees will be deducted from this amount with the remainder being paid directly to the student as a maintenance stipend.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Mo Ibrahim Foundation SOAS Scholarship 2026 Benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Mo Ibrahim Foundation SOAS Scholarship offers the following benefits;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>There are two awards available for 2026\u002F27, each with a total value of £45,479.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition fees will be deducted from this amount with the remainder being paid directly to the student as a maintenance stipend.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Mo Ibrahim Foundation Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the Mo Ibrahim Foundation Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be a newly admitted student, starting in September 2026.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be an Overseas fee status applicant.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have a minimum 2:1 bachelor’s degree from a UK university or international equivalent.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be a national of any Africa Country\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hold an unconditional offer for their programme by the time the scholarship panel meet.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Mo Ibrahim Foundation Scholarship 2026 Required Documents\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the Mo Ibrahim Foundation Scholarship 2026, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A copy of the unconditional offer received from SOAS admissions office.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>CV (please include your email address).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Two pages max statement outlining knowledge and interest in governance-related issues.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Your research proposal (as sent to the SOAS Admissions Office).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for Mo Ibrahim Foundation SOAS Scholarship 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the Mo Ibrahim Foundation SOAS Scholarship 2026, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Prepare the required documents\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Apply for your programme. Applicants applying for scholarships must submit an application for admission as soon as possible.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Apply for the scholarship by 12 noon UK local time on 17 June 2026. You must apply for this scholarship via the \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Feur01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com\u002F?url=https%3A%2F%2Fevision.soas.ac.uk%2Furd%2Fsits.urd%2Frun%2Fsiw_sso.go&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cjw84%40soas.ac.uk%7C9ee9b1fd0f474cf3f61d08de62311d9b%7C674dd0a1ae6242c7a39f69ee199537a8%7C0%7C0%7C639056160251013377%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=AuE5hcw66DoWwYRXrULQBQ05OyGqF5TzCtoao1dAvwY%3D&amp;reserved=0\">admissions portal\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Deadline: June 30th, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.soas.ac.uk\u002Fstudy\u002Fstudent-life\u002Ffinance\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmo-ibrahim-foundation-scholarship\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.soas.ac.uk\u002Fstudy\u002Fstudent-life\u002Ffinance\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmo-ibrahim-foundation-scholarship\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskoll",16,"published",0,"2026-06-17 15:04:06",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmo-ibrahim-foundation-soas-scholarship-2026-at-university-of-london-for-africans-fully-funded\u002F6a32a956221388.16307819_screenshot 2026-06-17 145523.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmo-ibrahim-foundation-soas-scholarship-2026-at-university-of-london-for-africans-fully-funded\u002F6a32a956221388.16307819_screenshot%202026-06-17%20145523.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",3,[29,3